  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Ὀ’χλὸς δ’ ἐς ὀφθὸν ’αὐτὶρ ἐπηςίζιτο,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">Ἐ’σχλᾶνα δ’ ἰγχαίρσιον ἄλλων ἐυθείας</l>
    <l n="3">Ἐ’τεινων, ἐξέτεινων, ἢλωσαν χεῖρας,</l>
    <l n="4">Πέδας δὲ καθήλωσαν ἐν πηκτῇ ξύλῳ.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Quorum versuum (haud sanè *</l>
    <l n="6">optimorum, liberè dicam) hæc</l>
    <l n="7">sententia. <i>Duƈtum &amp; subduƈtum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>in altam crucem ad ultimum ejus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>finem : rectum ita statutum : tum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>ad transversarium lignum manus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>fixas : denique &amp; pedes ad stipitem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>desixum.</i> Atque ista pro Erectâ.</l>
    <l n="13">In dissensu autem nos quid defi-</l>
    <l n="14">nimus ? consensum, quâ licet.</l>
    <l n="15">Dicimus utrumque usurpatum,</l>
    <l n="16">sæpiùs tamen hoc postremum.</l>
    <l n="17">Imò interim necessariò hoc po-</l>
    <l n="18">stremum. Pone enim in arbore</l>
    <l n="19">suspensos (sæpe factum :) quo-</l>
    <l n="20">modo demitti ea potuit, &amp; tunc</l>
    <l n="21">attolli?</l>
  </main_text>
